<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="zh-CN">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>数维数据管家系统 - 数据资产化深度调研</title>
    <link href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap@5.1.3/dist/css/bootstrap.min.css" rel="stylesheet">
    <link href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap-icons@1.8.0/font/bootstrap-icons.css" rel="stylesheet">
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Roboto+Mono:wght@400;500;600;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
    <style>
        :root {
            --primary-color: #1B3A57;
            --primary-dark: #0F4C81;
            --primary-light: #2E5A7C;
            --tech-accent: #00D2FF;
            --tech-secondary: #4ECDC4;
            --success-color: #2ECC71;
            --success-light: #58D68D;
            --danger-color: #FF6B6B;
            --warning-color: #FF9F43;
            --danger-light: #FFB3B3;
            --bg-primary: #F5F7FA;
            --bg-card: #FFFFFF;
            --bg-dark: #0B1120;
            --text-primary: #1B3A57;
            --text-secondary: #5A6C7D;
            --text-disabled: #99A8B8;
            --border-light: #E8EDF2;
            --border-focus: #1B3A57;
            --gradient-brand: linear-gradient(135deg, #1B3A57 0%, #00D2FF 100%);
            --gradient-tech: linear-gradient(135deg, #00D2FF 0%, #4ECDC4 100%);
            --font-family-zh: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "PingFang SC", "HarmonyOS Sans", "Microsoft YaHei", sans-serif;
            --font-family-num: "Roboto Mono", "DIN Alternate", "SF Mono", monospace;
        }
        
        * {
            box-sizing: border-box;
        }
        
        body {
            font-family: var(--font-family-zh);
            background: var(--bg-primary);
            min-height: 100vh;
            padding: 20px 0;
        }
        
        .header-section {
            background: var(--bg-card);
            border-radius: 16px;
            padding: 32px 40px;
            margin-bottom: 24px;
            box-shadow: 0 4px 20px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.05);
            border: 1px solid var(--border-light);
            position: relative;
            overflow: hidden;
        }
        
        .header-section::before {
            content: '';
            position: absolute;
            top: 0;
            left: 0;
            right: 0;
            height: 4px;
            background: var(--gradient-brand);
        }
        
        .header-title {
            color: var(--primary-color);
            font-weight: 600;
            font-size: 26px;
            margin-bottom: 8px;
            letter-spacing: -0.5px;
        }
        
        .header-title i {
            color: var(--tech-accent);
            margin-right: 12px;
        }
        
        .header-subtitle {
            color: var(--text-secondary);
            font-size: 14px;
            font-weight: 400;
        }
        
        .header-info {
            margin-top: 16px;
            padding: 12px 16px;
            background: rgba(0, 210, 255, 0.05);
            border-radius: 8px;
            border-left: 3px solid var(--tech-accent);
        }
        
        .header-info i {
            color: var(--tech-accent);
        }
        
        .form-container {
            background: var(--bg-card);
            border-radius: 16px;
            padding: 40px;
            box-shadow: 0 4px 20px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.05);
            border: 1px solid var(--border-light);
        }
        
        .step-indicator {
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
            margin-bottom: 32px;
            position: relative;
            padding: 0 20px;
        }
        
        .step-indicator::before {
            content: '';
            position: absolute;
            top: 18px;
            left: 40px;
            right: 40px;
            height: 2px;
            background: var(--border-light);
            z-index: 1;
        }
        
        .step-indicator .progress-line {
            position: absolute;
            top: 18px;
            left: 40px;
            height: 2px;
            background: var(--gradient-brand);
            z-index: 2;
            transition: width 0.5s ease;
            width: 0%;
        }
        
        .step {
            text-align: center;
            position: relative;
            z-index: 3;
            flex: 1;
        }
        
        .step-circle {
            width: 36px;
            height: 36px;
            border-radius: 50%;
            background: var(--bg-card);
            border: 2px solid var(--border-light);
            color: var(--text-disabled);
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            margin: 0 auto 8px;
            font-weight: 600;
            font-size: 14px;
            transition: all 0.3s ease;
        }
        
        .step.active .step-circle {
            background: var(--primary-color);
            border-color: var(--primary-color);
            color: white;
            box-shadow: 0 0 0 4px rgba(27, 58, 87, 0.15);
        }
        
        .step.completed .step-circle {
            background: var(--success-color);
            border-color: var(--success-color);
            color: white;
            box-shadow: 0 0 8px rgba(46, 204, 113, 0.4);
        }
        
        .step.completed .step-circle i {
            font-size: 16px;
        }
        
        .step-label {
            font-size: 12px;
            color: var(--text-disabled);
            font-weight: 500;
            transition: all 0.3s ease;
        }
        
        .step.active .step-label {
            color: var(--primary-color);
            font-weight: 600;
        }
        
        .step.completed .step-label {
            color: var(--success-color);
        }
        
        .progress-section {
            margin-bottom: 32px;
            padding: 16px 20px;
            background: rgba(27, 58, 87, 0.03);
            border-radius: 12px;
        }
        
        .progress-header {
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
            align-items: center;
            margin-bottom: 12px;
        }
        
        .progress-label {
            font-size: 13px;
            color: var(--text-secondary);
            font-weight: 500;
        }
        
        .progress-value {
            font-family: var(--font-family-num);
            font-size: 14px;
            font-weight: 600;
            color: var(--primary-color);
        }
        
        .progress-segmented {
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
            gap: 4px;
        }
        
        .progress-node {
            flex: 1;
            height: 6px;
            border-radius: 3px;
            background: var(--border-light);
            transition: all 0.3s ease;
        }
        
        .progress-node.completed {
            background: var(--success-color);
            box-shadow: 0 0 6px rgba(46, 204, 113, 0.3);
        }
        
        .progress-node.active {
            background: var(--tech-accent);
            animation: node-pulse 1.5s ease-in-out infinite;
        }
        
        @keyframes node-pulse {
            0%, 100% { opacity: 0.7; }
            50% { opacity: 1; }
        }
        
        .form-section {
            display: none;
        }
        
        .form-section.active {
            display: block;
            animation: fadeIn 0.4s ease;
        }
        
        @keyframes fadeIn {
            from { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(16px); }
            to { opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0); }
        }
        
        .section-title {
            color: var(--primary-color);
            font-size: 20px;
            font-weight: 600;
            margin-bottom: 8px;
            padding-left: 16px;
            border-left: 4px solid var(--tech-accent);
            letter-spacing: -0.3px;
        }
        
        .section-title i {
            color: var(--tech-accent);
            margin-right: 10px;
        }
        
        .section-desc {
            color: var(--text-secondary);
            font-size: 13px;
            margin-bottom: 24px;
            padding-left: 20px;
        }
        
        .form-question {
            margin-bottom: 20px;
            padding: 20px;
            background: var(--bg-primary);
            border-radius: 12px;
            border-left: 3px solid var(--tech-accent);
            transition: all 0.3s ease;
        }
        
        .form-question:hover {
            background: rgba(0, 210, 255, 0.03);
        }
        
        .form-question:focus-within {
            border-left-color: var(--primary-color);
            background: rgba(27, 58, 87, 0.02);
        }
        
        .question-label {
            font-weight: 600;
            color: var(--text-primary);
            margin-bottom: 12px;
            font-size: 14px;
            display: block;
        }
        
        .required-mark {
            color: var(--danger-color);
            margin-left: 4px;
        }
        
        .form-control, .form-select {
            border: 1px solid var(--border-light);
            border-radius: 8px;
            padding: 10px 14px;
            font-size: 14px;
            color: var(--text-primary);
            transition: all 0.2s ease;
        }
        
        .form-control:focus, .form-select:focus {
            border-color: var(--primary-color);
            box-shadow: 0 0 0 3px rgba(27, 58, 87, 0.1);
            outline: none;
        }
        
        ::placeholder {
            color: var(--text-disabled);
            opacity: 1;
        }
        
        .form-control:focus::placeholder {
            color: transparent;
        }
        
        .form-check-input {
            width: 18px;
            height: 18px;
            margin-top: 0;
            cursor: pointer;
        }
        
        .form-check-input:checked {
            background-color: var(--primary-color);
            border-color: var(--primary-color);
        }
        
        .form-check-input:focus {
            box-shadow: 0 0 0 3px rgba(27, 58, 87, 0.15);
        }
        
        .form-check-label {
            font-size: 14px;
            color: var(--text-primary);
            cursor: pointer;
            margin-left: 4px;
        }
        
        .form-check {
            margin-bottom: 8px;
        }
        
        .btn-custom {
            padding: 12px 28px;
            font-weight: 600;
            border-radius: 10px;
            transition: all 0.2s ease;
            font-size: 14px;
        }
        
        .btn-custom:active {
            transform: scale(0.98);
        }
        
        .btn-primary-custom {
            background: var(--gradient-brand);
            color: white;
            border: none;
            box-shadow: 0 4px 12px rgba(27, 58, 87, 0.25);
        }
        
        .btn-primary-custom:hover {
            box-shadow: 0 6px 20px rgba(27, 58, 87, 0.35);
            transform: translateY(-2px);
            color: white;
        }
        
        .btn-secondary-custom {
            background: var(--bg-card);
            color: var(--text-secondary);
            border: 1px solid var(--border-light);
        }
        
        .btn-secondary-custom:hover {
            background: var(--bg-primary);
            color: var(--text-primary);
            border-color: var(--border-focus);
        }
        
        .btn-success-custom {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #2ECC71 0%, #27AE60 100%);
            color: white;
            border: none;
            box-shadow: 0 4px 12px rgba(46, 204, 113, 0.3);
        }
        
        .btn-success-custom:hover {
            box-shadow: 0 6px 20px rgba(46, 204, 113, 0.4);
            transform: translateY(-2px);
            color: white;
        }
        
        .btn-success-custom::after {
            content: " ✓";
            display: inline-block;
        }
        
        .input-group-text {
            background: var(--bg-primary);
            border: 1px solid var(--border-light);
            color: var(--text-secondary);
            font-size: 14px;
        }
        
        .form-range {
            height: 8px;
        }
        
        .form-range::-webkit-slider-thumb {
            background: var(--primary-color);
            box-shadow: 0 2px 6px rgba(27, 58, 87, 0.3);
        }
        
        .form-range::-webkit-slider-runnable-track {
            background: var(--border-light);
            border-radius: 4px;
        }
        
        .badge {
            font-family: var(--font-family-num);
            font-weight: 500;
            padding: 6px 12px;
            border-radius: 6px;
        }
        
        .badge.bg-primary {
            background: var(--primary-color) !important;
        }
        
        .other-input-wrapper {
            margin-top: 12px;
            padding: 12px 16px;
            background: rgba(0, 210, 255, 0.05);
            border-radius: 8px;
            border-left: 3px solid var(--tech-accent);
        }
        
        .other-input-wrapper input,
        .other-input-wrapper textarea {
            border: 1px dashed var(--tech-accent);
            background: var(--bg-card);
        }
        
        .other-input-wrapper input:focus,
        .other-input-wrapper textarea:focus {
            border-style: solid;
            border-color: var(--primary-color);
        }
        
        .other-input-label {
            font-size: 12px;
            color: var(--tech-accent);
            margin-bottom: 8px;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 4px;
        }
        
        .skeleton {
            background: linear-gradient(
                90deg,
                var(--border-light) 25%,
                var(--bg-card) 50%,
                var(--border-light) 75%
            );
            background-size: 200% 100%;
            animation: skeleton-loading 1.5s infinite;
            border-radius: 8px;
        }
        
        @keyframes skeleton-loading {
            0% { background-position: 200% 0; }
            100% { background-position: -200% 0; }
        }
        
        @keyframes slideIn {
            from { transform: translateX(100%); opacity: 0; }
            to { transform: translateX(0); opacity: 1; }
        }
        
        @keyframes slideOut {
            from { transform: translateX(0); opacity: 1; }
            to { transform: translateX(100%); opacity: 0; }
        }
        
        .loading-overlay {
            position: fixed;
            top: 0;
            left: 0;
            right: 0;
            bottom: 0;
            background: rgba(11, 17, 32, 0.9);
            display: none;
            justify-content: center;
            align-items: center;
            flex-direction: column;
            z-index: 9999;
        }
        
        .loading-overlay.active {
            display: flex;
        }
        
        .engine-breathing {
            width: 80px;
            height: 80px;
            border-radius: 50%;
            background: radial-gradient(circle, 
                rgba(0, 210, 255, 0.4) 0%, 
                transparent 70%);
            animation: engine-breathe 2s ease-in-out infinite;
            margin-bottom: 24px;
        }
        
        @keyframes engine-breathe {
            0%, 100% { transform: scale(0.95); opacity: 0.6; }
            50% { transform: scale(1.1); opacity: 1; }
        }
        
        .loading-text {
            color: white;
            font-size: 16px;
            font-weight: 500;
        }
        
        .loading-subtext {
            color: var(--tech-accent);
            font-size: 13px;
            margin-top: 8px;
        }
        
        .nav-vip-badge {
            display: inline-flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 4px;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #FF9F43 0%, #F7931A 100%);
            color: white;
            padding: 2px 8px;
            border-radius: 10px;
            font-size: 11px;
            font-weight: 600;
            margin-left: 8px;
        }
        
        .nav-vip-badge i {
            font-size: 10px;
        }
        
        @media (max-width: 768px) {
            .header-section {
                padding: 24px 20px;
            }
            
            .form-container {
                padding: 24px 20px;
            }
            
            .step-indicator {
                padding: 0;
            }
            
            .step-indicator::before {
                left: 18px;
                right: 18px;
            }
            
            .step-indicator .progress-line {
                left: 18px;
            }
            
            .step-circle {
                width: 32px;
                height: 32px;
                font-size: 12px;
            }
            
            .step-label {
                font-size: 10px;
            }
            
            .form-question {
                padding: 16px;
            }
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="container" style="max-width: 900px;">
        <!-- 顶部导航 -->
        <div class="d-flex justify-content-between align-items-center mb-3" style="padding: 0 10px;">
            <div class="d-flex align-items-center gap-2">
                <span style="font-size: 13px; color: var(--text-secondary);">
                    <i class="bi bi-person-circle"></i>
                    <span id="navUserName">游客</span>
                </span>
            </div>
            <div class="d-flex gap-2">
                <a href="/history" class="btn btn-sm" style="background: rgba(0, 210, 255, 0.1); color: var(--tech-accent); border: 1px solid rgba(0, 210, 255, 0.3); font-size: 12px;">
                    <i class="bi bi-clock-history"></i> 历史报告
                </a>
                <button id="navLogoutBtn" onclick="handleLogout()" class="btn btn-sm" style="display: none; background: rgba(255, 107, 107, 0.1); color: var(--danger-color); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 107, 107, 0.3); font-size: 12px;">
                    <i class="bi bi-box-arrow-right"></i> 退出
                </button>
                <a id="navLoginBtn" href="/login" class="btn btn-sm" style="background: rgba(27, 58, 87, 0.1); color: var(--primary-color); border: 1px solid var(--border-light); font-size: 12px;">
                    <i class="bi bi-box-arrow-in-right"></i> 登录
                </a>
            </div>
        </div>
        
        <div class="header-section text-center">
            <h1 class="header-title">
                <i class="bi bi-pie-chart-fill"></i>数维·数据资产管家 - 数据要素资产化深度调研表
            </h1>
            <p class="header-subtitle">
                Shuwei Data Element Assetization Deep Survey
            </p>
            <div class="header-info">
                <small class="text-muted">
                    <i class="bi bi-info-circle me-1"></i>
                    填写完成后，系统将基于<b>数维·智规融合引擎 v1.0</b>，自动生成包含成熟度评分、诊断结果、转化路径、价值预测的专业报告
                </small>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="form-container">
            <div class="step-indicator">
                <div class="progress-line" id="progress-line"></div>
                <div class="step active" data-step="1">
                    <div class="step-circle">1</div>
                    <div class="step-label">机构画像</div>
                </div>
                <div class="step" data-step="2">
                    <div class="step-circle">2</div>
                    <div class="step-label">合规安全</div>
                </div>
                <div class="step" data-step="3">
                    <div class="step-circle">3</div>
                    <div class="step-label">数据资源</div>
                </div>
                <div class="step" data-step="4">
                    <div class="step-circle">4</div>
                    <div class="step-label">确权成本</div>
                </div>
                <div class="step" data-step="5">
                    <div class="step-circle">5</div>
                    <div class="step-label">价值需求</div>
                </div>
                <div class="step" data-step="6">
                    <div class="step-circle">6</div>
                    <div class="step-label">联系信息</div>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="progress-section">
                <div class="progress-header">
                    <span class="progress-label"><i class="bi bi-bar-chart me-1"></i>填写进度</span>
                    <span class="progress-value" id="progress-text">17%</span>
                </div>
                <div class="progress-segmented" id="progress-segments">
                    <div class="progress-node active"></div>
                    <div class="progress-node"></div>
                    <div class="progress-node"></div>
                    <div class="progress-node"></div>
                    <div class="progress-node"></div>
                    <div class="progress-node"></div>
                </div>
            </div>

            <form id="surveyForm">
                <div class="form-section active" data-section="1">
                    <h2 class="section-title">
                        <i class="bi bi-building"></i>第一部分：机构基础画像
                    </h2>
                    <p class="section-desc">
                        用于确定行业基准、政策匹配度及企业规模系数。<span class="text-danger">*</span> 号为必填项
                    </p>

                    <div class="form-question">
                        <label class="question-label">
                            1.1 机构名称 <span class="required-mark">*</span>
                        </label>
                        <input type="text" class="form-control" name="org_name" required placeholder="请填写机构全称">
                    </div>

                    <div class="form-question">
                        <label class="question-label">
                            1.2 机构类型 <span class="required-mark">*</span>
                        </label>
                        <div>
                            <div class="form-check form-check-inline">
                                <input class="form-check-input" type="radio" name="org_type" value="企业机构" required>
                                <label class="form-check-label">企业机构</label>
                            </div>
                            <div class="form-check form-check-inline">
                                <input class="form-check-input" type="radio" name="org_type" value="政府机构">
                                <label class="form-check-label">政府机构</label>
                            </div>
                            <div class="form-check form-check-inline">
                                <input class="form-check-input" type="radio" name="org_type" value="事业单位">
                                <label class="form-check-label">事业单位</label>
                            </div>
                            <div class="form-check form-check-inline">
                                <input class="form-check-input" type="radio" name="org_type" value="科研院所">
                                <label class="form-check-label">科研院所</label>
                            </div>
                            <div class="form-check form-check-inline">
                                <input class="form-check-input" type="radio" name="org_type" value="高校">
                                <label class="form-check-label">高校</label>
                            </div>
                            <div class="form-check form-check-inline">
                                <input class="form-check-input" type="radio" name="org_type" value="社会组织">
                                <label class="form-check-label">社会组织</label>
                            </div>
                            <div class="form-check form-check-inline">
                                <input class="form-check-input" type="radio" name="org_type" value="其他" id="org_type_other" onchange="toggleOtherInput(this)">
                                <label class="form-check-label">其他</label>
                            </div>
                            <div class="other-input-wrapper d-none mt-2">
                                <input type="text" class="form-control" name="org_type_other" placeholder="请填写其他机构类型">
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>

                    <div class="form-question">
                        <label class="question-label">
                            1.3 在册人员规模 <span class="required-mark">*</span>
                        </label>
                        <select class="form-select" name="staff_size" required>
                            <option value="">请选择</option>
                            <option value="50 人及以下">50 人及以下</option>
                            <option value="51-100 人">51-100 人</option>
                            <option value="101-500 人">101-500 人</option>
                            <option value="500 人以上">500 人以上</option>
                        </select>
                    </div>

                    <div class="form-question">
                        <label class="question-label">
                            1.4 注册地/运营地 <span class="required-mark">*</span>
                        </label>
                        <div class="row">
                            <div class="col-md-6 mb-2">
                                <select class="form-select" name="province" id="province" required onchange="updateCities()">
                                    <option value="">请选择省份</option>
                                    <option value="四川省">四川省</option>
                                    <option value="重庆市">重庆市</option>
                                    <option value="北京市">北京市</option>
                                    <option value="天津市">天津市</option>
                                    <option value="河北省">河北省</option>
                                    <option value="山西省">山西省</option>
                                    <option value="内蒙古自治区">内蒙古自治区</option>
                                    <option value="辽宁省">辽宁省</option>
                                    <option value="吉林省">吉林省</option>
                                    <option value="黑龙江省">黑龙江省</option>
                                    <option value="上海市">上海市</option>
                                    <option value="江苏省">江苏省</option>
                                    <option value="浙江省">浙江省</option>
                                    <option value="安徽省">安徽省</option>
                                    <option value="福建省">福建省</option>
                                    <option value="江西省">江西省</option>
                                    <option value="山东省">山东省</option>
                                    <option value="河南省">河南省</option>
                                    <option value="湖北省">湖北省</option>
                                    <option value="湖南省">湖南省</option>
                                    <option value="广东省">广东省</option>
                                    <option value="广西壮族自治区">广西壮族自治区</option>
                                    <option value="海南省">海南省</option>
                                    <option value="贵州省">贵州省</option>
                                    <option value="云南省">云南省</option>
                                    <option value="西藏自治区">西藏自治区</option>
                                    <option value="陕西省">陕西省</option>
                                    <option value="甘肃省">甘肃省</option>
                                    <option value="青海省">青海省</option>
                                    <option value="宁夏回族自治区">宁夏回族自治区</option>
                                    <option value="新疆维吾尔自治区">新疆维吾尔自治区</option>
                                </select>
                            </div>
                            <div class="col-md-6 mb-2">
                                <select class="form-select" name="city" id="city" required disabled>
                                    <option value="">请先选择省份</option>
                                </select>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>

                    <div class="form-question">
                        <label class="question-label">
                            1.5 是否设有专门的数据管理部门？ <span class="required-mark">*</span>
                        </label>
                        <div>
                            <div class="form-check form-check-inline">
                                <input class="form-check-input" type="radio" name="has_data_dept" value="是" required onchange="toggleDeptInput()">
                                <label class="form-check-label">是</label>
                            </div>
                            <div class="form-check form-check-inline">
                                <input class="form-check-input" type="radio" name="has_data_dept" value="否" onchange="toggleDeptInput()">
                                <label class="form-check-label">否</label>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                        <input type="text" class="form-control mt-2" name="dept_name" id="dept_name" placeholder="若有，请填写部门名称" disabled>
                    </div>

                    <div class="form-question">
                        <label class="question-label">
                            1.6 现有知识产权存量 <span class="required-mark">*</span>
                        </label>
                        <div class="row">
                            <div class="col-md-3">
                                <input type="number" class="form-control" name="ip_trademark" placeholder="商标 (件)" min="0">
                            </div>
                            <div class="col-md-3">
                                <input type="number" class="form-control" name="ip_patent" placeholder="专利 (件)" min="0">
                            </div>
                            <div class="col-md-3">
                                <input type="number" class="form-control" name="ip_copyright" placeholder="软著 (件)" min="0">
                            </div>
                            <div class="col-md-3">
                                <input type="number" class="form-control" name="ip_work" placeholder="作品著作权 (件)" min="0">
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>

                    <div class="form-question">
                        <label class="question-label">
                            1.7 年营收规模 (企业填)
                        </label>
                        <select class="form-select" name="revenue">
                            <option value="">请选择</option>
                            <option value="<5000 万"><5000 万</option>
                            <option value="5000 万 -2 亿">5000 万 -2 亿</option>
                            <option value="2 亿 -10 亿">2 亿 -10 亿</option>
                            <option value=">10 亿">&gt;10 亿</option>
                            <option value="不适用">不适用</option>
                        </select>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <div class="form-section" data-section="2">
                    <h2 class="section-title">
                        <i class="bi bi-shield-check"></i>第二部分：合规与安全底座
                    </h2>
                    <p class="section-desc">
                        对应报告维度：合规性 (30%)。此部分决定是否存在"一票否决"风险。
                    </p>

                    <div class="form-question">
                        <label class="question-label">
                            2.1 数据主要来源 <span class="required-mark">*</span> (多选)
                        </label>
                        <div>
                            <div class="form-check">
                                <input class="form-check-input" type="checkbox" name="data_source" value="内部系统">
                                <label class="form-check-label">内部系统 (数据库/文件服务器)</label>
                            </div>
                            <div class="form-check">
                                <input class="form-check-input" type="checkbox" name="data_source" value="用户自主提供">
                                <label class="form-check-label">用户自主提供</label>
                            </div>
                            <div class="form-check">
                                <input class="form-check-input" type="checkbox" name="data_source" value="公共数据授权">
                                <label class="form-check-label">公共数据授权</label>
                            </div>
                            <div class="form-check">
                                <input class="form-check-input" type="checkbox" name="data_source" value="外部采购">
                                <label class="form-check-label">外部采购/合作共享</label>
                            </div>
                            <div class="form-check">
                                <input class="form-check-input" type="checkbox" name="data_source" value="爬虫采集">
                                <label class="form-check-label">爬虫/公开采集</label>
                            </div>
                            <div class="form-check">
                                <input class="form-check-input" type="checkbox" name="data_source" value="其他" onchange="toggleOtherInput(this)">
                                <label class="form-check-label">其他</label>
                            </div>
                            <div class="other-input-wrapper d-none mt-2">
                                <input type="text" class="form-control" name="data_source_other" placeholder="请填写其他数据来源">
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>

                    <div class="form-question">
                        <label class="question-label">
                            2.2 用户授权情况 <span class="required-mark">*</span>
                        </label>
                        <div>
                            <div class="form-check form-check-inline">
                                <input class="form-check-input" type="radio" name="user_auth" value="有明确隐私协议且单独同意" required>
                                <label class="form-check-label">有明确隐私协议且单独同意</label>
                            </div>
                            <div class="form-check form-check-inline">
                                <input class="form-check-input" type="radio" name="user_auth" value="有概括性协议">
                                <label class="form-check-label">有概括性协议</label>
                            </div>
                            <div class="form-check form-check-inline">
                                <input class="form-check-input" type="radio" name="user_auth" value="无明确协议">
                                <label class="form-check-label">无明确协议</label>
                            </div>
                            <div class="form-check form-check-inline">
                                <input class="form-check-input" type="radio" name="user_auth" value="不涉及个人数据">
                                <label class="form-check-label">不涉及个人数据</label>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>

                    <div class="form-question">
                        <label class="question-label">
                            2.3 敏感数据处理方式 <span class="required-mark">*</span>
                        </label>
                        <div>
                            <div class="form-check form-check-inline">
                                <input class="form-check-input" type="radio" name="sensitive_data" value="已脱敏/匿名化 (不可复原)" required>
                                <label class="form-check-label">已脱敏/匿名化 (不可复原)</label>
                            </div>
                            <div class="form-check form-check-inline">
                                <input class="form-check-input" type="radio" name="sensitive_data" value="加密存储">
                                <label class="form-check-label">加密存储</label>
                            </div>
                            <div class="form-check form-check-inline">
                                <input class="form-check-input" type="radio" name="sensitive_data" value="明文存储">
                                <label class="form-check-label">明文存储</label>
                            </div>
                            <div class="form-check form-check-inline">
                                <input class="form-check-input" type="radio" name="sensitive_data" value="未涉及敏感数据">
                                <label class="form-check-label">未涉及敏感数据</label>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>

                    <div class="form-question">
                        <label class="question-label">
                            2.4 是否采用数据加密技术？ <span class="required-mark">*</span>
                        </label>
                        <div>
                            <div class="form-check form-check-inline">
                                <input class="form-check-input" type="radio" name="data_encrypt" value="是 (传输/存储均加密)" required>
                                <label class="form-check-label">是 (传输/存储均加密)</label>
                            </div>
                            <div class="form-check form-check-inline">
                                <input class="form-check-input" type="radio" name="data_encrypt" value="部分加密">
                                <label class="form-check-label">部分加密</label>
                            </div>
                            <div class="form-check form-check-inline">
                                <input class="form-check-input" type="radio" name="data_encrypt" value="否">
                                <label class="form-check-label">否</label>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>

                    <div class="form-question">
                        <label class="question-label">
                            2.5 数据安全认证情况
                        </label>
                        <div>
                            <div class="form-check">
                                <input class="form-check-input" type="checkbox" name="security_cert" value="DSMM 三级">
                                <label class="form-check-label">DSMM 三级</label>
                            </div>
                            <div class="form-check">
                                <input class="form-check-input" type="checkbox" name="security_cert" value="ISO27001">
                                <label class="form-check-label">ISO27001</label>
                            </div>
                            <div class="form-check">
                                <input class="form-check-input" type="checkbox" name="security_cert" value="等保三级">
                                <label class="form-check-label">等保三级</label>
                            </div>
                            <div class="form-check">
                                <input class="form-check-input" type="checkbox" name="security_cert" value="无">
                                <label class="form-check-label">无</label>
                            </div>
                            <div class="form-check">
                                <input class="form-check-input" type="checkbox" name="security_cert" value="其他" onchange="toggleOtherInput(this)">
                                <label class="form-check-label">其他</label>
                            </div>
                            <div class="other-input-wrapper d-none mt-2">
                                <input type="text" class="form-control" name="security_cert_other" placeholder="请填写其他安全认证">
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>

                    <div class="form-question">
                        <label class="question-label">
                            2.6 是否建立专门数据管理制度？ <span class="required-mark">*</span>
                        </label>
                        <div>
                            <div class="form-check form-check-inline">
                                <input class="form-check-input" type="radio" name="data_policy" value="是 (有正式发文)" required>
                                <label class="form-check-label">是 (有正式发文)</label>
                            </div>
                            <div class="form-check form-check-inline">
                                <input class="form-check-input" type="radio" name="data_policy" value="否">
                                <label class="form-check-label">否</label>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>

                    <div class="form-question">
                        <label class="question-label">
                            2.7 历史合规事件
                        </label>
                        <div>
                            <div class="form-check form-check-inline">
                                <input class="form-check-input" type="radio" name="compliance_history" value="无">
                                <label class="form-check-label">无</label>
                            </div>
                            <div class="form-check form-check-inline">
                                <input class="form-check-input" type="radio" name="compliance_history" value="有过整改记录">
                                <label class="form-check-label">有过整改记录</label>
                            </div>
                            <div class="form-check form-check-inline">
                                <input class="form-check-input" type="radio" name="compliance_history" value="有过行政处罚">
                                <label class="form-check-label">有过行政处罚</label>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <div class="form-section" data-section="3">
                    <h2 class="section-title">
                        <i class="bi bi-database"></i>第三部分：数据资源与治理质量
                    </h2>
                    <p class="section-desc">
                        对应报告维度：治理质量 (20%)。用于计算"质量系数"及匹配应用场景。
                    </p>

                    <div class="form-question">
                        <label class="question-label">
                            3.1 拥有的数据资源类型 <span class="required-mark">*</span> (多选)
                        </label>
                        <div>
                            <div class="form-check">
                                <input class="form-check-input" type="checkbox" name="data_type" value="核心运营数据" required>
                                <label class="form-check-label">核心运营数据 (研发/生产/供应链/设备等)</label>
                            </div>
                            <div class="form-check">
                                <input class="form-check-input" type="checkbox" name="data_type" value="用户与市场数据">
                                <label class="form-check-label">用户与市场数据 (行为/会员/交易/画像等)</label>
                            </div>
                            <div class="form-check">
                                <input class="form-check-input" type="checkbox" name="data_type" value="科研与公共服务数据">
                                <label class="form-check-label">科研与公共服务数据 (实验/交通/医疗/环境监测等)</label>
                            </div>
                            <div class="form-check">
                                <input class="form-check-input" type="checkbox" name="data_type" value="技术开发数据">
                                <label class="form-check-label">技术开发数据 (代码/算法/标注/文档等)</label>
                            </div>
                            <div class="form-check">
                                <input class="form-check-input" type="checkbox" name="data_type" value="其他" onchange="toggleOtherInput(this)">
                                <label class="form-check-label">其他</label>
                            </div>
                            <div class="other-input-wrapper d-none mt-2">
                                <input type="text" class="form-control" name="data_type_other" placeholder="请填写其他数据资源类型">
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>

                    <div class="form-question">
                        <label class="question-label">
                            3.2 数据创新成果形态 <span class="required-mark">*</span> (多选)
                        </label>
                        <div>
                            <div class="form-check">
                                <input class="form-check-input" type="checkbox" name="data_product" value="结构化数据集" required>
                                <label class="form-check-label">结构化数据集</label>
                            </div>
                            <div class="form-check">
                                <input class="form-check-input" type="checkbox" name="data_product" value="数据算法模型">
                                <label class="form-check-label">数据算法模型</label>
                            </div>
                            <div class="form-check">
                                <input class="form-check-input" type="checkbox" name="data_product" value="数据产品 (API/报告)">
                                <label class="form-check-label">数据产品 (API/报告)</label>
                            </div>
                            <div class="form-check">
                                <input class="form-check-input" type="checkbox" name="data_product" value="研究报告">
                                <label class="form-check-label">研究报告</label>
                            </div>
                            <div class="form-check">
                                <input class="form-check-input" type="checkbox" name="data_product" value="数字 IP/可视化内容">
                                <label class="form-check-label">数字 IP/可视化内容</label>
                            </div>
                            <div class="form-check">
                                <input class="form-check-input" type="checkbox" name="data_product" value="数据合规认证">
                                <label class="form-check-label">数据合规认证</label>
                            </div>
                            <div class="form-check">
                                <input class="form-check-input" type="checkbox" name="data_product" value="其他" onchange="toggleOtherInput(this)">
                                <label class="form-check-label">其他</label>
                            </div>
                            <div class="other-input-wrapper d-none mt-2">
                                <input type="text" class="form-control" name="data_product_other" placeholder="请填写其他数据产品形态">
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>

                    <div class="form-question">
                        <label class="question-label">
                            3.3 数据存储位置
                        </label>
                        <div>
                            <div class="form-check form-check-inline">
                                <input class="form-check-input" type="radio" name="storage_location" value="自有服务器" onchange="toggleCloudProviderInput()">
                                <label class="form-check-label">自有服务器</label>
                            </div>
                            <div class="form-check form-check-inline">
                                <input class="form-check-input" type="radio" name="storage_location" value="云存储" onchange="toggleCloudProviderInput()">
                                <label class="form-check-label">云存储</label>
                            </div>
                            <div class="form-check form-check-inline">
                                <input class="form-check-input" type="radio" name="storage_location" value="混合存储" onchange="toggleCloudProviderInput()">
                                <label class="form-check-label">混合存储</label>
                            </div>
                            <input type="text" class="form-control d-inline-block" style="width: 150px;" name="cloud_provider" id="cloud_provider" placeholder="服务商名称" disabled>
                        </div>
                    </div>

                    <div class="form-question">
                        <label class="question-label">
                            3.4 主要数据格式
                        </label>
                        <div>
                            <div class="form-check">
                                <input class="form-check-input" type="checkbox" name="data_format" value="Excel/CSV">
                                <label class="form-check-label">Excel/CSV</label>
                            </div>
                            <div class="form-check">
                                <input class="form-check-input" type="checkbox" name="data_format" value="JSON/XML">
                                <label class="form-check-label">JSON/XML</label>
                            </div>
                            <div class="form-check">
                                <input class="form-check-input" type="checkbox" name="data_format" value="关系型数据库">
                                <label class="form-check-label">关系型数据库</label>
                            </div>
                            <div class="form-check">
                                <input class="form-check-input" type="checkbox" name="data_format" value="图形数据库">
                                <label class="form-check-label">图形数据库</label>
                            </div>
                            <div class="form-check">
                                <input class="form-check-input" type="checkbox" name="data_format" value="其他" onchange="toggleOtherInput(this)">
                                <label class="form-check-label">其他</label>
                            </div>
                            <div class="other-input-wrapper d-none" data-for="data_format_other">
                                <div class="other-input-label">
                                    <i class="bi bi-pencil"></i> 请填写其他数据格式
                                </div>
                                <input type="text" class="form-control" name="data_format_other" placeholder="例如：NoSQL数据库、时序数据库等">
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>

                    <div class="form-question">
                        <label class="question-label">
                            3.5 数据量级 <span class="required-mark">*</span>
                        </label>
                        <div class="mb-3">
                            <label class="form-label fw-bold">数据条数：</label>
                            <div>
                                <div class="form-check form-check-inline">
                                    <input class="form-check-input" type="radio" name="data_volume_records" value="<10 万" required>
                                    <label class="form-check-label">&lt;10 万</label>
                                </div>
                                <div class="form-check form-check-inline">
                                    <input class="form-check-input" type="radio" name="data_volume_records" value="10 万 -100 万">
                                    <label class="form-check-label">10 万 -100 万</label>
                                </div>
                                <div class="form-check form-check-inline">
                                    <input class="form-check-input" type="radio" name="data_volume_records" value="100 万 -1000 万">
                                    <label class="form-check-label">100 万 -1000 万</label>
                                </div>
                                <div class="form-check form-check-inline">
                                    <input class="form-check-input" type="radio" name="data_volume_records" value="1000 万 -1 亿">
                                    <label class="form-check-label">1000 万 -1 亿</label>
                                </div>
                                <div class="form-check form-check-inline">
                                    <input class="form-check-input" type="radio" name="data_volume_records" value=">1 亿">
                                    <label class="form-check-label">&gt;1 亿</label>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                        <div>
                            <label class="form-label fw-bold">数据大小：</label>
                            <div>
                                <div class="form-check form-check-inline">
                                    <input class="form-check-input" type="radio" name="data_volume_size" value="<1GB" required>
                                    <label class="form-check-label">&lt;1GB</label>
                                </div>
                                <div class="form-check form-check-inline">
                                    <input class="form-check-input" type="radio" name="data_volume_size" value="1GB-10GB">
                                    <label class="form-check-label">1GB-10GB</label>
                                </div>
                                <div class="form-check form-check-inline">
                                    <input class="form-check-input" type="radio" name="data_volume_size" value="10GB-100GB">
                                    <label class="form-check-label">10GB-100GB</label>
                                </div>
                                <div class="form-check form-check-inline">
                                    <input class="form-check-input" type="radio" name="data_volume_size" value="100GB-1TB">
                                    <label class="form-check-label">100GB-1TB</label>
                                </div>
                                <div class="form-check form-check-inline">
                                    <input class="form-check-input" type="radio" name="data_volume_size" value="1TB-10TB">
                                    <label class="form-check-label">1TB-10TB</label>
                                </div>
                                <div class="form-check form-check-inline">
                                    <input class="form-check-input" type="radio" name="data_volume_size" value=">10TB">
                                    <label class="form-check-label">&gt;10TB</label>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>

                    <div class="form-question">
                        <label class="question-label">
                            3.6 数据更新频率 <span class="required-mark">*</span>
                        </label>
                        <select class="form-select" name="update_frequency" required>
                            <option value="">请选择</option>
                            <option value="实时">实时</option>
                            <option value="天级">天级</option>
                            <option value="周级">周级</option>
                            <option value="月级">月级</option>
                            <option value="静态一次性">静态一次性</option>
                        </select>
                    </div>

                    <div class="form-question">
                        <label class="question-label">
                            3.7 关键字段完整性估算 <span class="required-mark">*</span>
                        </label>
                        <input type="range" class="form-range" name="completeness" min="0" max="100" step="5" required oninput="updateCompletenessValue(this.value)">
                        <div class="text-center mt-2">
                            <span class="badge fs-6" id="completeness_badge" style="font-family: var(--font-family-num); transition: all 0.3s ease;">当前值：<span id="completeness_value">50%</span></span>
                        </div>
                    </div>

                    <div class="form-question">
                        <label class="question-label">
                            3.8 主要应用场景 <span class="required-mark">*</span> (多选)
                        </label>
                        <div>
                            <div class="form-check">
                                <input class="form-check-input" type="checkbox" name="application_scenario" value="精准营销" required>
                                <label class="form-check-label">精准营销</label>
                            </div>
                            <div class="form-check">
                                <input class="form-check-input" type="checkbox" name="application_scenario" value="风险控制">
                                <label class="form-check-label">风险控制</label>
                            </div>
                            <div class="form-check">
                                <input class="form-check-input" type="checkbox" name="application_scenario" value="产品优化">
                                <label class="form-check-label">产品优化</label>
                            </div>
                            <div class="form-check">
                                <input class="form-check-input" type="checkbox" name="application_scenario" value="政府决策">
                                <label class="form-check-label">政府决策</label>
                            </div>
                            <div class="form-check">
                                <input class="form-check-input" type="checkbox" name="application_scenario" value="模型训练">
                                <label class="form-check-label">模型训练</label>
                            </div>
                            <div class="form-check">
                                <input class="form-check-input" type="checkbox" name="application_scenario" value="交易流通">
                                <label class="form-check-label">交易流通</label>
                            </div>
                            <div class="form-check">
                                <input class="form-check-input" type="checkbox" name="application_scenario" value="其他" onchange="toggleOtherInput(this)">
                                <label class="form-check-label">其他</label>
                            </div>
                            <div class="other-input-wrapper d-none" data-for="application_scenario_other">
                                <div class="other-input-label">
                                    <i class="bi bi-pencil"></i> 请填写其他应用场景
                                </div>
                                <input type="text" class="form-control" name="application_scenario_other" placeholder="例如：智能推荐、预测分析等">
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <div class="form-section" data-section="4">
                    <h2 class="section-title">
                        <i class="bi bi-file-earmark-check"></i>第四部分：确权现状与成本计量
                    </h2>
                    <p class="section-desc">
                        对应报告维度：确权 (20%) + 成本 (10%)。判断"双轨制"可行性及入表障碍。
                    </p>

                    <div class="form-question">
                        <label class="question-label">
                            4.1 对数据要素概念了解程度
                        </label>
                        <div>
                            <div class="form-check form-check-inline">
                                <input class="form-check-input" type="radio" name="data_concept" value="非常了解">
                                <label class="form-check-label">非常了解</label>
                            </div>
                            <div class="form-check form-check-inline">
                                <input class="form-check-input" type="radio" name="data_concept" value="基本了解">
                                <label class="form-check-label">基本了解</label>
                            </div>
                            <div class="form-check form-check-inline">
                                <input class="form-check-input" type="radio" name="data_concept" value="不了解">
                                <label class="form-check-label">不了解</label>
                            </div>
                        </div>
